SUMMARY:Pollinator Garden Workday (Norwood)
DESCRIPTION:NCWF Uwharrie Wildlife Stewards Chapter will meet at South Stanly Middle School on May 26th at 9:00 AM to help spread mulch and work in the school’s pollinator garden\, which serves as a Pitstop along the Butterfly Highway. \nStudents and community members are encouraged to come out\, get their hands dirty\, and support one of our local schools in the Uwharrie Region. This is a great opportunity to help create habitat for pollinators while giving back to the community. \nRain Date: Wednesday\, May 27th at 9 AM \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/pollinator-garden-workday-norwood/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/PollinatorGardenWorkday.jpg
END:VEVENT
